 "U01051": "\"All right, heads!\" \"No, wait… tails after all!\"",
 "U01125": "\"Then, heads…\" \"Actually, maybe tails?\"",
 "U01249": "\"We need Hongo after all.\" \"We'll do it ourselves this time.\"",
 "U01256": "\"We do need Mr. Hongo.\" \"Let's do it ourselves this time.\"",
 "U01575": "\"Let's leave the doctor to Jiro.\" \"Rescuing Dr. Komyoji comes first.\"",
 "U02557": "\"They're set on it… let's do it!\" \"Too dangerous… they shouldn't.\"",
 "U02563": "\"Let's try! For both their sakes…\" \"Too dangerous… they shouldn't.\"",
 "U03449": "\"Rider 1 (Hongo) is abroad\" \"Rider 2 (Ichimonji) is abroad\"",
 "U03497": "\"Sounds like a steam train…\" \"No way… a steam train out here?\"",
 "U03522": "\"No… I definitely heard it.\" \"Figures… a steam train out here?\"",
 "U06569": "\"Ide became a doctor\" \"Ide did not become a doctor\"",
 "U06955": "\"Joji Yuki (Riderman) is here\" \"Joji Yuki (Riderman) is not here\"",
 "U08394": "\"Go to Aki Sakata's party\" \"Go to Rumi Sahara's party\" \"Go to neither\"",
 "U08764": "\"Sigh… you win, Mr. Oiwa…\" \"Hold on a minute here\"",
 "U12743": "\"Sounds fine to me, right?\" \"But there are the others…\"",
 "U12744": "\"Doesn't that sound fine?\" \"But there are the others…\"",
 "U13301": "\"Right, Oyassan's got a point!\" \"But still, even so…\"",
 "U13978": "\"Cleared Stage 82: Guillotine gone\" \"Cleared Stage 63: Iron Mask gone\"",
